ByteTrack algorithm provenance
==============================

The CPU tracker in src/tracker/byte_tracker.cpp is an independent
implementation of the ByteTrack association method described in the
FoundationVision/ByteTrack project, pinned for review to commit
d1bf0191adff59bc8fcfeaa0b33d3d1642552a99:
https://github.com/FoundationVision/ByteTrack/tree/d1bf0191adff59bc8fcfeaa0b33d3d1642552a99

The upstream project is licensed under the MIT License, copyright (c) 2021
Yifu Zhang. The upstream license text is reproduced below. This repository's
tracker does not copy DeepStream-specific source files; it implements the
high/low confidence association stages, track lifecycle, and Kalman prediction
independently with time-based state transitions.

